// Name: Suspicious Inbox Rule Creation
// Author: MFA meex
// Date: 2026-05-11
// Description: Detects suspicious inbox rule creation or modification activity in Exchange.
// Reference: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/defender-xdr/alert-grading-playbook-inbox-manipulation-rules
// Note: Tune known administrative accounts / service accounts to reduce false positives. Good chance for false positives, better for smaller orgs.

OfficeActivity
| where OfficeWorkload == "Exchange"
// Detect newly created or modified inbox rules
| where Operation in~ ("New-InboxRule", "Set-InboxRule")
| project TimeGenerated, UserId, ClientIP, Operation, Parameters, ResultStatus
| sort by TimeGenerated desc
